    mechanism: "A single intravenous infusion of chimeric antigen receptor (CAR)-transduced autologous T cells directed against CD19, engineered with PD-1 and TIGIT knock-down to enhance T-cell effector function, given after fludarabine/cyclophosphamide conditioning.",
